   "alt": "The main ring of the strongman's tent under a patched red-and-cream big top, painted in ink and gouache: a three-tier round stage around a central pole. Ryan swings on the trapeze ropes with his top hat flying, a blank board with a black bow hangs on the pole, a strongman in a green cap lifts a cow, another stands motionless under a mobile of dumbbells, a strongwoman carries a table top, a strongman taps a lead weight, a knight raises a feather duster, a bull stands steady while a crate tips over, a strongman lounges on cushions, Nan peers over her knitting at a mouse lifting dumbbells, a helmeted traveller yawns, a lion hides behind his paw by a barrel, and below the stage a mole drives a tiny train through a tunnel. Curtained archways with a dove, a boxing glove and a medal lead to side rooms, four little balcony doors open above, and a curtain bottom left opens onto the park path.",
